22:45.760 --> 22:46.360
[cerah.]

22:47.640 --> 22:48.720
[Selamat ulang tahun untukku.]

22:49.440 --> 22:51.560
[Dia bilang semoga aku selamanya
berani mencintai dan membenci,]

22:52.520 --> 22:53.760
[semoga segalanya selalu berjalan lancar.]

22:54.720 --> 22:55.680
[Hingga kini,]

22:56.320 --> 22:57.480
[doa terasa seperti kutukan.]

22:58.520 --> 22:59.440
[Aku hanya ada mati rasa,]

22:59.640 --> 23:00.760
[hanya hidup di masa lalu,]

23:01.800 --> 23:03.040
[hanya dihantui mimpi buruk.]

23:13.720 --> 23:15.720
